Role to model policy
ROLE         MODEL                        SOURCE   WHY
lead         anthropic/claude-haiku-5-5   builtin  orchestrates the pod; never edits code
implementer  anthropic/claude-sonnet-5-5  builtin  writes code in the project workspace
reviewer     anthropic/claude-sonnet-5-5  builtin  read-only veto on the work of the step before
researcher   anthropic/claude-sonnet-5-5  builtin  gathers and synthesizes source material
analyst      anthropic/claude-haiku-5-5   builtin  analyzes data/evidence and draws conclusions
writer       anthropic/claude-haiku-5-5   builtin  drafts the pod's content deliverable
operator     anthropic/claude-sonnet-5-5  builtin  executes real operational actions
monitor      anthropic/claude-haiku-5-5   builtin  observes signals and reports status; no
                                                   unilateral action
actor        anthropic/claude-sonnet-5-5  builtin  sends what the step before approved, nothing else
default  anthropic/claude-sonnet-4-6
rank anchors  anthropic/claude-opus-5-5 -> anthropic/claude-sonnet-5-5 -> anthropic/claude-haiku-5-5
